  "rationale": "ExprTyped/ArgsTyped lift Shared judgments while preserving bindings and checking before/after Context.WellFormed. BindingTyped extends metadata with bindingTypes while reusing Shared.BindingTyped. LocalTyped sequences expression and pattern. StatementTyped.store types the RHS before calling store on the resulting context. Call/dropStruct constructors preserve the preceding behavior with lifted judgments. These are formal rules, not a claim of general progress or preservation.",
